{"ticker":"ZTS","updated":"2026-10-30T23:24:40Z","profile":{"longName":"Zoetis Inc.","shortName":"Zoetis Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"United States","website":"https://www.zoetis.com","fullTimeEmployees":14500,"marketCap":32942186496,"trailingPE":13.111842,"forwardPE":12.440466,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.4584973,"pegRatio":14.67,"targetMeanPrice":88.38462,"targetHighPrice":115.0,"targetLowPrice":74.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.002,"earningsGrowth":0.012,"grossMargins":0.71738,"operatingMargins":0.40721,"profitMargins":0.27685,"totalRevenue":9525000192,"beta":0.74,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":144.83,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":68.77,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.69},"summary":"Zoetis Inc. engages in the discovery, development, manufacture, and commercialization of medicines, vaccines, diagnostic products and services, biodevices, genetic tests, and precision animal health solutions for the animal health industry in the United States and internationally. The company commercializes products primarily across companion animals comprising dogs, cats, and horses; and species, including livestock, such as cattle, swine, poultry, fish, and sheep. It also offers parasiticides, vaccines, dermatology, anti-infectives, pain and sedation, other pharmaceutical, and animal health diagnostics. In addition, the company provides animal health diagnostics, including point-of-care diagnostic products, instruments and reagents, rapid immunoassay tests, reference laboratory kits and services, and blood glucose monitors; and other non-pharmaceutical products, which include nutritionals, as well as products and services in biodevices, genetic tests, and precision animal health. It markets its products to veterinarians, livestock producers, and pet owners. The company has collaborated with Blacksmith Medicines, Inc. to discover and develop novel antibiotics for animal health. Zoetis Inc. was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Parsippany, New Jersey.","summary_zh":"Zoetis Inc. 致力於美國和國際動物保健行業的藥品、疫苗、診斷產品和服務、生物設備、基因測試和精準動物保健解決方案的發現、開發、製造和商業化。該公司主要將產品商業化於伴侶動物，包括狗、貓和馬；和物種，包括牲畜，如牛、豬、家禽、魚和羊。它還提供殺蟲劑、疫苗、皮膚科、抗感染藥、止痛藥和鎮靜藥、其他藥物和動物健康診斷。此外，該公司還提供動物健康診斷，包括即時診斷產品、儀器和試劑、快速免疫分析測試、參考實驗室套件和服務以及血糖監測儀；以及其他非藥物產品，包括營養品以及生物設備、基因測試和精準動物健康領域的產品和服務。該公司向獸醫、牲畜生產者和寵物主人銷售其產品。該公司與 Blacksmith Medicines, Inc. 合作，發現和開髮用於動物健康的新型抗生素。 Zoetis Inc.成立於2012年，總部位於新澤西州帕西帕尼。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 特用藥品和非專利藥品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":154.98,"h":155.38,"l":151.61,"c":152.88,"v":2228300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":152.34,"h":153.09,"l":151.46,"c":152.43,"v":1664700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":152.53,"h":153.49,"l":151.35,"c":153.2,"v":1538500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":152.9,"h":155.15,"l":152.4,"c":153.32,"v":1895900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":152.5,"h":152.97,"l":146.49,"c":151.75,"v":3313000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":151.41,"h":152.12,"l":149.64,"c":149.79,"v":1952600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":149.0,"h":150.58,"l":148.38,"c":149.42,"v":2734300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":149.78,"h":152.0,"l":149.42,"c":150.61,"v":3194000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":149.65,"h":150.05,"l":146.54,"c":148.2,"v":3111200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":148.08,"h":149.75,"l":145.89,"c":146.25,"v":3340600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":146.29,"h":148.57,"l":146.29,"c":147.46,"v":2664900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":147.5,"h":149.54,"l":146.56,"c":146.93,"v":1958300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":146.3,"h":148.04,"l":145.15,"c":147.1,"v":2739400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":147.75,"h":147.75,"l":145.3,"c":145.88,"v":4455800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":146.55,"h":146.71,"l":144.35,"c":144.65,"v":2044700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":143.25,"h":146.18,"l":141.53,"c":142.61,"v":3679500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":141.62,"h":144.01,"l":140.54,"c":141.67,"v":4224500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":141.33,"h":142.0,"l":139.34,"c":141.13,"v":3058500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":141.86,"h":143.79,"l":141.27,"c":143.5,"v":2575200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":143.