s.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":""},{"title":"Q2 earnings highs and lows: Collegium Pharmaceutical (NASDAQ:COLL) vs the rest of the branded pharmaceuticals stocks","src":"StockStory","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-25","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1555280/000155528026000011/zts-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Zoetis Inc. is a global leader in the animal health industry, focused on the discovery, development, manufacture and commercialization of medicines, vaccines, diagnostic products and services, biodevices, genetic tests and precision animal health. We have a diversified business, commercializing products across eight core species: dogs, cats and horses (collectively, companion animals) and cattle, swine, poultry, fish and sheep (collectively, livestock); and within seven major product categories: parasiticides, vaccines, dermatology, anti-infectives, pain and sedation, other pharmaceutical and animal health diagnostics. With a legacy of nearly 75 years, we continue to pioneer ways to predict, prevent, detect, and treat animal illness, supporting those raising and caring for animals worldwide - from veterinarians and pet owners to livestock producers.","zh":"Zoetis Inc.是動物保健行業的全球領導者，專注於藥物、疫苗、診斷產品和服務、生物設備、基因測試和精準動物保健的發現、開發、製造和商業化。我們擁有多元化的業務，將八個核心物種的產品商業化：狗、貓和馬（統稱為伴侶動物）以及牛、豬、家禽、魚和羊（統稱為牲畜）；七大產品類別：殺寄生蟲劑、疫苗、皮膚科、抗感染劑、疼痛和鎮靜劑、其他藥物和動物健康診斷劑。憑藉近 75 年的傳承，我們繼續開拓預測、預防、檢測和治療動物疾病的方法，為世界各地的動物飼養和護理人員（從獸醫和寵物主人到牲畜生產者）提供支持。"},{"en":"We were incorporated in Delaware in July 2012 and prior to that the company was a business unit of Pfizer Inc. (Pfizer). The address of our principal executive offices is 10 Sylvan Way, Parsippany, New Jersey 07054. Unless the context requires otherwise, references to \"Zoetis,\" \"the company,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\" in this Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2025 (2025 Annual Report) refer to Zoetis Inc., a Delaware corporation, and its subsidiaries. In addition, unless the context requires otherwise, references to \"Pfizer\" in this 2025 Annual Report refer to Pfizer Inc., a Delaware corporation, and its subsidiaries.","zh":"我們於 2012 年 7 月在德拉瓦州註冊成立，在此之前，該公司是輝瑞 (Pfizer) 的業務部門。我們主要執行辦公室的地址為 10 Sylvan Way, Parsippany, New Jersey 07054。除非上下文另有要求，否則本截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的 10-K 表格年度報告（2025 年年度報告）中提及的“碩騰”、“公司”、“我們”或“我們的”是指特拉華州公司碩騰公司及其子公司。此外，除非上下文另有要求，本 2025 年年度報告中提及的「輝瑞」是指特拉華州公司輝瑞公司及其子公司。"},{"en":"The animal health medicines, vaccines and diagnostics market is characterized by meaningful differences in customer needs across different regions. This is due to a variety of factors, including:","zh":"動物保健藥品、疫苗和診斷市場的特徵是不同地區的客戶需求有顯著差異。這是由於多種因素造成的，包括："}],"markets":[{"en":"Over the course of our history, we have focused on developing a diverse portfolio of animal health products that deliver solutions across the continuum of care. We typically refer to all products with the same primary active pharmaceutical or biological ingredient(s) as a single product line, even if such products include different brands, dosages, formulations or indicated species. For vaccines, we typically consider a group of vaccines as a single product line if they share the same brand. We have approximately 300 comprehensive product lines, including products for both companion animals and livestock within each of our major product categories.","zh":"在我們的歷史進程中，我們一直致力於開發多樣化的動物保健產品組合，為整個護理過程提供解決方案。我們通常將具有相同主要活性藥物或生物成分的所有產品視為單一產品線，即使此類產品包括不同的品牌、劑量、配方或指定物種。對於疫苗，如果一組疫苗具有相同的品牌，我們通常將其視為單一產品線。我們擁有大約 300 個綜合產品線，包括每個主要產品類別中的伴侶動物和牲畜產品。"},{"en":"Our companion animal products help extend and improve the quality of life for pets; increase convenience and compliance for pet owners; and help veterinarians improve the quality of their care and the efficiency of their businesses. Growth in the companion animal medicines, vaccines and diagnostics sectors is driven by increases in spending on pet care, economic development and related increases in disposable income. Companion animals are also living longer, deepening the human-animal bond, receiving increased medical treatment and benefiting from advances in animal health medicines, vaccines and diagnostics. Companion animal products represented approximately 70% of our revenue for the year ended December 31, 2025.","zh":"我們的伴侶動物產品有助於延長和提高寵物的生活品質；提高寵物主人的便利性和合規性；幫助獸醫提高護理品質和業務效率。寵物照護支出的增加、經濟發展以及相關可支配收入的增加推動了伴侶動物藥品、疫苗和診斷產業的成長。伴侶動物的壽命也更長，人與動物的連結加深，接受更多的醫療，並受益於動物保健藥物、疫苗和診斷技術的進步。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度，伴侶動物產品約占我們收入的 70%。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"United States","val":5097000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"International","val":4254000000,"zh":"國際"}],"total":9467000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Productsand Services","val":9351000000,"zh":"全部產品和服務"},{"name":"Companion Animal","val":6587000000,"zh":"伴侶動物"},{"name":"Horses","val":6283000000,"zh":"馬匹"},{"name":"Livestock","val":2764000000,"zh":"家畜"},{"name":"Parasiticides","val":2341000000,"zh":"殺寄生蟲劑"},{"name":"Vaccines","val":1959000000,"zh":"疫苗"},{"name":"Dermatology","val":1754000000,"zh":"皮膚科"},{"name":"Cattle","val":1492000000,"zh":"牛"},{"name":"Anti Infective Products","val":1036000000,"zh":"抗感染產品"},{"name":"Pain Sedation","val":840000000,"zh":"鎮痛"}],"total":9467000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Geographical Area","val":9351000000,"zh":"總地理面積"},{"name":"US","val":5097000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Emerging Markets","val":913000000,"zh":"其他新興市場"},{"name":"Other Developed Markets","val":641000000,"zh":"其他已開發市場"},{"name":"BR","val":393000000,"zh":"BR"},{"name":"AU","val":329000000,"zh":"非盟"},{"name":"GB","val":325000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"CA","val":290000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"DE","val":236000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"CN","val":227000000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":9467000000}},"peers":["IDXX","TMO","DHR","SPGI","EW"]}}